WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.670
On a battlefield, a
warrior lowers his bow.

2
00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.610
He does not want to fight.

3
00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:09.410
Should he walk away, or
do the duty that is his?

4
00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:12.490
Hindu tradition names four aims of life.

5
00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:16.520
Two of them may surprise
you: wealth, and pleasure.

6
00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:19.410
Is there one right way
for everyone to live,

7
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:22.690
or can the right thing
differ from person to person?

8
00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:26.740
In this mission, you'll explore
dharma: a word for duty,

9
00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:30.340
right living and the order
that holds the world together.

10
00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:35.560
Then you'll weigh up whether an ancient
ideal of duty still fits modern life.

11
00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:40.520
Your mission: find out whether Hindus
see one right way to live, or many.
